
load @term/base/code/network/http
  find response

task read
  note async
  take response, like response
  take format, like text, fall text <text>

  save raw, read response/dock

  fork case, read format
    case text
      send back
        call string
          text <data>
          read raw
          text <encoding>
          text <.utf8>
    case bytes
      send back, read raw
    case json
      send back
        call json-serialization/json-object
          text <with>
          read raw
          halt kink
    case stream
      send back, read raw
